# Google Maps Platform API Key (browser + Next.js Route Handler fallback)
# Obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping at:
#   https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#
# Steps to get your free Maps Demo Key:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
# 4. Generate and copy your demo API key
# 5. Copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder below
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional: Dedicated server-only key for Next.js BFF Route Handlers (/api/places/*, /api/geocode)
# If omitted, Route Handlers automatically fall back to NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_google_maps_api_key_here
